## Hints

- E2: the spread of estimates across the 500 small samples IS the sampling
  noise — compare its width to the gap between your estimates and the
  "true" model probability (computable exactly with scipy.stats.norm).
- E3: boolean Series mean() = frequency; uncertainty ≈ √(p(1−p)/n).
